{"id":"9a3d7d5a4faa2e4c9015bca1405b161deeca420e","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1243376","title":"chatgpt windows 桌面版，每个会话的第 2 轮的发送都变成不可用状态了。 我已经卸载并重新安装重启过了。不起作用。有啥解决办法吗？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"blackantt","excerpt":"OpenAI - @blackantt -","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n        <p><span>Supplement 1 &#160;·&#160; <span title=\"2026-09-20 16:45:31 +08:00\">19h 39m ago</span></span></p>\n        \n        <div><p>还是 fable 5.1 聪明，把现象汇报给它，它知道去查 github 上的 codex/chatgpt 的 issue 。然后说，这是这 2 天出现的 bug 。</p><p>codex app 本身就不知道去查，胡说一通。</p></div>\n        \n    </div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18106053\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/11ca/59d7/632236_normal.png?m=1749454732\" alt=\"woodchen\" data-uid=\"632236\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/woodchen\">woodchen</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-20 15:30:27 +08:00\">20h 54m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>没碰到过, 我看别人有 over xxx, 一般是账号风控了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18106519\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e70d/e620/17439_normal.png?m=1782439039\" alt=\"gy0624ww\" data-uid=\"17439\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/gy0624ww\">gy0624ww</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-20 16:48:20 +08:00\">19h 36m ago</span> \n            